              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Njoy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious recipe - my kids loved them. I added sweet potato and potato to the mix, and used wholemeal flour which gave it a little extra crunch. Great way to get kids to eat their veges!",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-30T04:47:22.817Z"
